Karen Sill was the [[Phenomena/Echo Fragment|Echo Fragment]]'s holder before [[Divinity/Althane/The Stranger|the Stranger]]. He was a lanky older humanoid, and he built [[Geography/Althane/The Hollow/Lava Ruin/index|the lava ruin]] on [[Geography/Althane/index|Althane]] to draw the divine energy slowly out of the ground. Vesper Feep had him dragged in and bound to a medical table, set a hand on his face, and took the fragment from him. He is dead.
